WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:04.960
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No submitting any incident

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.120
reports to the Darwin Awards!

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:11.709
The Darwin Awards honor incidents that exemplify
the law of natural selection, from someone

00:00:11.709 --> 00:00:15.679
taunting a hungry tiger to having a staring
contest with SCP-173.

00:00:15.679 --> 00:00:20.980
However, Dr. Bright is not permitted to submit
official incident reports to the Darwin Awards.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:24.710
No, Jack, not even if you are sure it would
win.

